rgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707630/extras/7a55de14ded03866fbc3c8be9973eceb.avif?t=1752873360\" width=616 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707630/extras/4c87931071a6996779c5809cd6f738d8.avif?t=1752873360\" width=616 height=176 /></span>Enlist a squad of potent creatures that will lend you their powerful combat enhancements. Gather rare materials along the way to  unleash the full potential of their skills.</p>","developers":["Team Verdant"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707630/c5f2909ec93c4db7983ed4f52f393b08825caa6e/header.jpg?t=1752873360","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2707630/662148/06472eefc1b2ef89f1e700c1c065b21cc94d1b44/1750892937/dash_av1.mpd?t=1707863519","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2707630/662148/06472eefc1b2ef89f1e700c1c065b21cc94d1b44/1750892937/dash_h264.mpd?t=1707863519","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2707630/662148/06472eefc1b2ef89f1e700c1c065b21cc94d1b44/1750892937/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1707863519","id":257000831,"name":"Twins of Olus | Early Gameplay Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257000831/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1707863519"}],"name":"Twins of Olus","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-82